{"articleNo":"243445","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=243445&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국장애인고용공단 대전직업능력개발원] 산학연계훈련과정 참여 장애인 훈련생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.10.08","hit":"4682","attachments":[{"name":"SK오앤에스 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=243445&attachNo=93043"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">한국장애인고용공단 대전직업능력개발원에서는 기업체 눈높이에 맞는 기능인력을 양성하기 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">SK</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">오앤에스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">와 함께하는</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">산학연계훈련과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: super; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">에 참여할 장애인 훈련생을 모집하오니 장애인 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여를 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">산학연계훈련과정이란</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">특정 기업체가 요구하는 장애인을 한국장애인고용공단 대전직업능력개발원에서 모집하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">장애인을 대상으로 집중 훈련을 시켜 일정 수준 이상의 기능을 갖추게 한 뒤 해당 기업체로 취업시키는 훈련과정</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"></span></span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\" data-jsonlen=\"9643\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--ㅡㅡㅡㅡ[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5028\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\